Step 1.3: Create the Database Schema
Create src/main/resources/schema.sql. This single script will be executed against both the "orders" and "inventory" H2 databases; each database only uses the table relevant to it, which keeps the example simple while still using two independent XA resources.

CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS orders (
